  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Herbal Dialect is the most concise way to learn about plants without the struggle of feeling like you're learning. Each playable card has a photo of a plant with all the information you need to Grow, Forage, Propagate, or Collect the real thing in your garden! </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">The cards themselves work as flash cards to grow plants, or in head to head games with your friends. Whether as a homeschooling resource, collections of photos, or the kickstart to get planting; everyone needs a refresh on the basics of nature.<br>We are currently able to offer a 15% Commission on affiliate link/codes used. Our goal is to provide an educational product at affordable prices so we apologize for not reaching a larger incentive yet. <br>Any reviews, word of mouth, marketing, or simply the conversation to a friend who might be interested is greatly appreciated. Feedback is highly appreciated in all directions so don't hesitate to speak the truth freely through your own lens. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">There is much more to come within the decks and new variations so if you like Gardening, Hiking, Foraging, House Plants, Cooking, Tea, Herbs, Spices, or even learning a new Language,  stick around and see what we have next! NEW DECKS BY OCTOBER (Over 4x the amount of cards with increased quality and visuals)</p></div></div>",
